00:42:25.260 --> 00:42:29.880
are usually based on certain axioms.

00:42:29.880 --> 00:42:32.700
And so there are based on certain theory,

00:42:32.700 --> 00:42:37.150
which is its identity is
determined by its axioms,

00:42:37.150 --> 00:42:42.150
and if you accept the
axioms, the proof is a proof.

00:42:42.300 --> 00:42:45.570
But there is a question of
